                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "· Add i18n framework to Astro website (e.g. astro-i18next)\n· Japanese (ja) + English (en) as initial locales\n· URL structure: /en/... and /ja/...\n· Translate: learn/, basics/, research/ pages\n· Keep incident/topic pages in EN with JP summaries\n· Add locale switcher to SiteHeader",
